# Vulnerabilities accepted after review. Each entry needs a reason and a
# revisit trigger; remove it as soon as a fixed version is adopted.

# The two spring-webmvc entries below are fixed in 6.2.20, which is not on
# Maven Central (OSS 6.2 patches have ended), and in Spring 7 (Boot 4).
# Revisit on the Boot 4 upgrade.

# XsltView SSRF/RCE. TrackFlow is a JSON API and never uses XsltView or any
# view resolver.
CVE-2026-47884

# SSE stream corruption, only "when using Server-Sent Events with view
# fragments". DeploymentStreamService sends JSON DTOs through SseEmitter and
# never renders view fragments.
CVE-2026-47890
